## Open Questions
- Adding pd to a running deployment without PD is allowed by the API;
  the real rollout behavior of that change was not tested.
- Whether the API defaults prefill concurrency when it is unset. If it
  does, the attribute needs Computed.
- Whether autoscaling claims are needed later.
